# Scene1-2-11

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐2-11
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1,ArmR8,ArmL7
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊啊啊——！|#0102Adv11_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:刚走进娱乐室，<br>艾玛就听见米莉亚那几乎刺破耳膜的惨叫声。|#0102Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚！？|#0102Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脸色唰的一下变白了，<br>她急忙跑到沙发那边。|#0102Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆息荒く

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，小、小艾……？|#0102Adv11_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你刚才的惨叫……|#0102Adv11_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv11_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:安安正在米莉亚的身旁坐着。<br>最近她们两个好像屁股长在沙发上，一定会出现在这里。<br>这时安安无言地直指前方。|#0102Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛回头一看，银幕上<br>正在播放电影。<br>看来现在在放恐怖片。|#0102Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚调节好呼吸后，<br>走到艾玛身边。|#0102Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:抱、抱歉，吵到你了。|#0102Adv11_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为安安非要缠着我让我放恐怖片看，<br>我就只好放了。|#0102Adv11_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……但大叔我真的害怕恐怖片啊……|#0102Adv11_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是这样啊，那就好。我还以为出什么事了。|#0102Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吓到你了吧……以后我会注意的……<br>明明你们在努力为计划做准备，<br>而我却在这里玩。|#0102Adv11_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系的，你不用太介意。<br>待在安全的地方对你也比较好。|#0102Adv11_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……也、也对。<br>毕竟还没有找到奈叶香……|#0102Adv11_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……她都消失好几天了，<br>到底是怎么藏这么久的。|#0102Adv11_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:最近看守也经常在外面巡逻，<br>我猜大概是在找奈叶香。|#0102Adv11_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:四处巡逻的看守好可怕啊……<br>要是越狱计划被发现，那可就糟了。|#0102Adv11_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们得提高警惕才行。<br>一定要让越狱计划成功。|#0102Adv11_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的话，<br>不知为何米莉亚的脸色有些消沉。|#0102Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们真的应该逃出去吗……|#0102Adv11_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:什么？|#0102Adv11_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，抱、抱歉！哎呀大叔我<br>总爱把事情往坏处想，真是个坏毛病。|#0102Adv11_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你别放在心上。|#0102Adv11_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和米莉亚聊着聊着，<br>忽然注意到安安站在旁边。|#0102Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv11_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她一言不发地拽住米莉亚的裙摆，<br>然后，狠狠地瞪着艾玛。|#0102Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，我打扰你们看电影了吧。<br>对不起，我这就走。|#0102Adv11_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（安安她最近看上去<br>　好像又把内心封闭起来了）|#0102Adv11_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不过有米莉亚陪着她，<br>　应该没事吧……？）|#0102Adv11_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管艾玛有些担心安安阴沉的模样，<br>但她还是马上离开了娱乐室。|#0102Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

